#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Poison Hail"
msgstr "Grandine velenosa"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the second key using only defensive strategies."
msgstr "Recupera la seconda chiave usando soltanto strategie difensive."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Retrieve the second <a object|key>key</a> (B). It should be located near "
"your current position."
msgstr ""
"Recupera la seconda <a object|key>chiave</a> (B). Dovrebbe essere vicina "
"alla tua posizione."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When your mission is completed and before taking off, bring both <a "
"object|botshld>shielder</a> and <a object|botsub>subber</a> aboard your "
"spaceship."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver completato la missione e prima di decollare, porta a bordo "
"dell’astronave il <a object|botshld>robot scudo</a> e il <a "
"object|botsub>robot sommergibile</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

